IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `dog-act-domain`

-- =============================================================================
-- Dog Act 1976 (Western Australia) -- Part V, The keeping of dogs (ss. 26-27)
--
-- Isomorphic encoding of s. 26 ("Limitation as to numbers") and s. 27
-- ("Licensing of approved kennel establishments"), as at the compilation
-- dated 28 Nov 2024 [version 08-b0-00], re-verified current 2026-09-09.
-- Source: mrdoc_47983.txt, lines 710-765, in
-- canon/subjects/western-australia/dog-act-1976/registers/source-bundle/.
--
-- This s. 26 ("Limitation as to numbers") is the Part V provision -- not to
-- be confused with any other section that historical renumbering may have
-- left sharing the bare number "26" elsewhere in this Act. Immediately
-- before Part V, the compilation carries the note "[Part IV heading
-- deleted: No. 23 of 1987 s. 21.]" (source line 654), recording that an
-- earlier Part IV was deleted and later provisions renumbered around the
-- gap -- the same kind of historical renumbering artefact this corpus met
-- once already in Division 1/2 (ss. 33D-33M, dog-act-1976.l4).
--
-- Every cross-reference inside ss. 26-27 stays inside this chunk: s. 26(1)
-- and s. 26(3) feed s. 26(4); s. 26(1)(a)/(b) and s. 26(2)(c) feed s. 27(1)
-- and s. 27(2); "dangerous dog (declared)"/"dangerous dog (restricted
-- breed)" are the same s. 3 terms dog-act-domain.l4's DogProfile already
-- carries, read here only as plain headcounts, not by importing DogProfile
-- itself. Nothing in this chunk reaches a section outside its own line
-- range, so there is no cross-Part reference to scope out here -- the one
-- perennial exception is the Interpretation Act 1984 s. 71 "further
-- offence" multiplier, already scoped out once, in dog-act-domain.l4's
-- Penalty record, and simply reused here as a MAYBE NUMBER field.
-- =============================================================================

§ `Part V -- The keeping of dogs`
§§ `26. Limitation as to numbers`

-- s. 26(1): enabling power. A local government MAY, by local law, limit (a)
-- the number of dogs (>= 3 months of age) kept at premises in its district,
-- or (b) the number of dogs of a specified breed kept there. This is a
-- grant of rule-making power with no fact of its own to test; the CONTENT
-- limits on such a local law are s. 26(2)'s validity predicate below, and
-- the numeric result of exercising the power is what s. 26(4)(a)'s offence
-- reads as a plain NUMBER "the limit applicable to the premises".

DECLARE `Local Law Limit` HAS
    `number specified as the limit`                                                                         IS A NUMBER
    `limit purports to apply to dogs kept at a licensed approved kennel establishment (s 26(2)(c))`          IS A BOOLEAN
    `limit purports to apply to dangerous dogs (declared) or dangerous dogs (restricted breed) (s 26(2)(d))` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref Dog Act 1976 (WA) s. 26(2)(a)
GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the specified limit is one the local law may adopt (2, 3, 4, 5 or 6 only)` n MEANS
        n EQUALS 2
    OR  n EQUALS 3
    OR  n EQUALS 4
    OR  n EQUALS 5
    OR  n EQUALS 6

-- s. 26(2)(b) ("cannot prevent the keeping ... of one or 2 dogs ... and any
-- pup of either of those dogs under that age") is declaratory of the floor
-- (2)(a)'s range already guarantees, and of the fact that a pup under 3
-- months is never counted against the limit at all. Both points are
-- already carried by the range test above and by s. 26(4)(a)'s own
-- "reached 3 months of age" qualifier below, so (b) adds no further,
-- independently-testable constraint of its own.

@ref Dog Act 1976 (WA) s. 26(2)
GIVEN limit IS A `Local Law Limit`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`a local law limit under s 26(1) is validly made` limit MEANS
        `the specified limit is one the local law may adopt (2, 3, 4, 5 or 6 only)` (limit's `number specified as the limit`)
    AND NOT limit's `limit purports to apply to dogs kept at a licensed approved kennel establishment (s 26(2)(c))`
    AND NOT limit's `limit purports to apply to dangerous dogs (declared) or dangerous dogs (restricted breed) (s 26(2)(d))`

DECLARE `S26(3) Exemption` HAS
    `local government is satisfied the approved-kennel-establishment provisions need not be applied to these premises`                IS A BOOLEAN
    `number of dogs (reached 3 months of age) the exemption purports to authorise`                                                    IS A NUMBER
    `exemption purports to authorise keeping an underage dog that is not a pup of a dog whose keeping is authorised by the exemption` IS A BOOLEAN

-- s. 26(3)(a) ("may be made subject to conditions") and s. 26(3)(c) ("may
-- be revoked or varied at any time") are permissive powers the local
-- government holds over its own exemption, not restrictions on what a
-- valid exemption may say -- neither yields a fact of the exemption to
-- test, so only (3)(b)'s cap is encoded below.

@ref Dog Act 1976 (WA) s. 26(3)(b)
GIVEN ex IS A `S26(3) Exemption`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`an exemption under s 26(3) is validly made` ex MEANS
        ex's `local government is satisfied the approved-kennel-establishment provisions need not be applied to these premises`
    AND ex's `number of dogs (reached 3 months of age) the exemption purports to authorise` AT MOST 6
    AND NOT ex's `exemption purports to authorise keeping an underage dog that is not a pup of a dog whose keeping is authorised by the exemption`

DECLARE `S26(4) Keeping Facts` HAS
    `premises are licensed under s 27 as an approved kennel establishment`                                             IS A BOOLEAN
    `number of dogs kept at the premises that have reached 3 months of age, other than dangerous dogs`                 IS A NUMBER
    `the limit applicable to the premises under a local law made under s 26(1), or an exemption granted under s 26(3)` IS A NUMBER
    `number of dangerous dogs (declared) kept at the premises that have reached 3 months of age`                       IS A NUMBER
    `number of dangerous dogs (restricted breed) kept at the premises that have reached 3 months of age`               IS A NUMBER
    `a pup of a dangerous dog (restricted breed), under 3 months of age, is kept at the premises`                      IS A BOOLEAN

@ref Dog Act 1976 (WA) s. 26(4)(a)
GIVEN f IS A `S26(4) Keeping Facts`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 26(4)(a) offence -- exceeding the applicable dog-number limit` f MEANS
        NOT f's `premises are licensed under s 27 as an approved kennel establishment`
    AND f's `number of dogs kept at the premises that have reached 3 months of age, other than dangerous dogs`
            GREATER THAN f's `the limit applicable to the premises under a local law made under s 26(1), or an exemption granted under s 26(3)`

-- AMBIGUITY (F-S26-4-B-DANGEROUS-DOG-CAP): s. 26(4)(b) reads "more than -- (i)
-- 2 dangerous dogs (declared); or (ii) 2 dangerous dogs (restricted
-- breed); or (iii) one of each of those kinds of dangerous dogs, that have
-- reached 3 months of age". Taken reading: limb (iii) bites when BOTH
-- counts individually exceed 1 at the same premises -- the most literal
-- transcription of "more than ... one of each of those kinds", and
-- consistent with the statute's own structure of three independently-
-- violable "or"-joined limbs. Rejected reading: some other combined-total
-- cap (e.g. a single mixed headcount ceiling of 2 dogs regardless of kind)
-- -- nothing in the wording folds declared-count and restricted-count into
-- one sum, and a rule that meant that would more naturally have said "more
-- than 2 dangerous dogs of either or both kinds".
@ref Dog Act 1976 (WA) s. 26(4)(b)
GIVEN f IS A `S26(4) Keeping Facts`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 26(4)(b) offence -- exceeding the permitted number of dangerous dogs` f MEANS
    LET `keeps more than one dangerous dog of each kind` MEANS
            f's `number of dangerous dogs (declared) kept at the premises that have reached 3 months of age` GREATER THAN 1
        AND f's `number of dangerous dogs (restricted breed) kept at the premises that have reached 3 months of age` GREATER THAN 1
    IN
            NOT f's `premises are licensed under s 27 as an approved kennel establishment`
        AND (   f's `number of dangerous dogs (declared) kept at the premises that have reached 3 months of age` GREATER THAN 2
             OR f's `number of dangerous dogs (restricted breed) kept at the premises that have reached 3 months of age` GREATER THAN 2
             OR `keeps more than one dangerous dog of each kind`)

@ref Dog Act 1976 (WA) s. 26(4)(c)
GIVEN f IS A `S26(4) Keeping Facts`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 26(4)(c) offence -- keeping an underage restricted-breed pup outside a licensed kennel` f MEANS
        NOT f's `premises are licensed under s 27 as an approved kennel establishment`
    AND f's `a pup of a dangerous dog (restricted breed), under 3 months of age, is kept at the premises`

@ref Dog Act 1976 (WA) s. 26(4)
GIVEN f IS A `S26(4) Keeping Facts`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 26(4) offence -- keeping too many dogs, or an underage restricted-breed pup, outside a licensed kennel` f MEANS
        `s 26(4)(a) offence -- exceeding the applicable dog-number limit` f
    OR  `s 26(4)(b) offence -- exceeding the permitted number of dangerous dogs` f
    OR  `s 26(4)(c) offence -- keeping an underage restricted-breed pup outside a licensed kennel` f

-- s. 26(4) Penalty: limb (a) is "an offence relating to a dog other than a
-- dangerous dog"; limbs (b) and (c) are both "relating to a dangerous dog".
`s 26(4) penalty -- relating to a dangerous dog` MEANS
    Penalty WITH fine IS JUST 10_000, `minimum fine` IS JUST 500, `imprisonment months` IS NOTHING, `further offence fine` IS JUST 500

`s 26(4) penalty -- relating to a dog other than a dangerous dog` MEANS
    Penalty WITH fine IS JUST 5_000, `minimum fine` IS NOTHING, `imprisonment months` IS NOTHING, `further offence fine` IS JUST 100

@ref Dog Act 1976 (WA) s. 26(4) Penalty
GIVEN f IS A `S26(4) Keeping Facts`
GIVETH A Penalty
`s 26(4) penalty` f MEANS
    IF      `s 26(4)(b) offence -- exceeding the permitted number of dangerous dogs` f
        OR  `s 26(4)(c) offence -- keeping an underage restricted-breed pup outside a licensed kennel` f
    THEN `s 26(4) penalty -- relating to a dangerous dog`
    ELSE `s 26(4) penalty -- relating to a dog other than a dangerous dog`

DECLARE `S26(5) Review Facts` HAS
    `aggrieved by the conditions imposed on an exemption under s 26(3)` IS A BOOLEAN
    `aggrieved by a refusal to grant such an exemption`                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `aggrieved by the revocation of such an exemption`                  IS A BOOLEAN

@ref Dog Act 1976 (WA) s. 26(5)
GIVEN f IS A `S26(5) Review Facts`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`a person may apply to SAT for review under s 26(5)` f MEANS
        f's `aggrieved by the conditions imposed on an exemption under s 26(3)`
    OR  f's `aggrieved by a refusal to grant such an exemption`
    OR  f's `aggrieved by the revocation of such an exemption`

DECLARE Part5Party IS ONE OF
    `Aggrieved Person`

DECLARE Part5Action IS ONE OF
    `apply to the State Administrative Tribunal for review under s 26(5)`

@ref Dog Act 1976 (WA) s. 26(6)
`s 26(6) -- deadline to apply to SAT for review under s 26(5)` MEANS
    PARTY `Aggrieved Person`
    MAY   `apply to the State Administrative Tribunal for review under s 26(5)`
    WITHIN 28
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST  FULFILLED

§§ `27. Licensing of approved kennel establishments`

DECLARE `S27(1) Application Trigger` HAS
    `a limit is imposed under s 26(1)(a) or (b) on the number of dogs that can be kept at the premises` IS A BOOLEAN
    `person proposes to keep more than that number of dogs in or at premises in that area`              IS A BOOLEAN
    `the premises are not exempt from the limitation`                                                    IS A BOOLEAN

@ref Dog Act 1976 (WA) s. 27(1)
GIVEN t IS A `S27(1) Application Trigger`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the person must apply under s 27(1) for the premises to be licensed as an approved kennel establishment` t MEANS
        t's `a limit is imposed under s 26(1)(a) or (b) on the number of dogs that can be kept at the premises`
    AND t's `person proposes to keep more than that number of dogs in or at premises in that area`
    AND t's `the premises are not exempt from the limitation`

DECLARE `S27(2) Offence Facts` HAS
    `dog kept, or permitted or suffered to be kept, is over the age of 3 months`                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `dog is of a breed or kind to which the licence applies`                                        IS A BOOLEAN
    `dog is kept at an approved kennel establishment`                                                IS A BOOLEAN
    `the keeping is otherwise than in accordance with the licence relating to that establishment`    IS A BOOLEAN

@ref Dog Act 1976 (WA) s. 27(2)
GIVEN f IS A `S27(2) Offence Facts`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 27(2) offence -- keeping a dog at an approved kennel establishment otherwise than in accordance with its licence` f MEANS
        f's `dog kept, or permitted or suffered to be kept, is over the age of 3 months`
    AND f's `dog is of a breed or kind to which the licence applies`
    AND f's `dog is kept at an approved kennel establishment`
    AND f's `the keeping is otherwise than in accordance with the licence relating to that establishment`

@ref Dog Act 1976 (WA) s. 27(2) Penalty
`s 27(2) penalty` MEANS
    Penalty WITH fine IS JUST 5_000, `minimum fine` IS NOTHING, `imprisonment months` IS NOTHING, `further offence fine` IS JUST 100

-- s. 27(3) (kennel/yard construction and siting standards a local law may
-- prescribe) and s. 27(4) (the local government's manner-and-form and
-- notice/objection process for granting a licence) are administrative
-- machinery -- discretion the local government exercises over how it makes
-- and processes local laws and applications, not a fact about a person's
-- or a dog's own circumstances -- so neither is encoded as an operative
-- predicate here.

DECLARE `S27(5) Licence Status Facts` HAS
    `months elapsed since the licence was granted or last renewed` IS A NUMBER
    `the licence has been cancelled under s 27(6)`                 IS A BOOLEAN

@ref Dog Act 1976 (WA) s. 27(5)
GIVEN f IS A `S27(5) Licence Status Facts`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the approved kennel establishment licence remains in force` f MEANS
        NOT f's `the licence has been cancelled under s 27(6)`
    AND f's `months elapsed since the licence was granted or last renewed` AT MOST 12

DECLARE `S27(6) Cancellation Notice` HAS
    `period specified in the notice, in months, at the end of which the licence is cancelled` IS A NUMBER

@ref Dog Act 1976 (WA) s. 27(6)
GIVEN n IS A `S27(6) Cancellation Notice`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the s 27(6) cancellation notice satisfies its content requirement` n MEANS
    n's `period specified in the notice, in months, at the end of which the licence is cancelled` AT LEAST 3

DECLARE `S27(7) Review Facts` HAS
    `the local government refuses the grant of a licence under s 27` IS A BOOLEAN
    `notice of the cancellation of a licence under s 27 is given`    IS A BOOLEAN

@ref Dog Act 1976 (WA) s. 27(7)
GIVEN f IS A `S27(7) Review Facts`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the applicant or licensee may apply to SAT for review under s 27(7)` f MEANS
        f's `the local government refuses the grant of a licence under s 27`
    OR  f's `notice of the cancellation of a licence under s 27 is given`

-- =============================================================================
-- Illustrations
-- =============================================================================

§ `Illustrations`

`a compliant local law limit` MEANS `Local Law Limit` WITH
    `number specified as the limit` IS 4
    , `limit purports to apply to dogs kept at a licensed approved kennel establishment (s 26(2)(c))` IS FALSE
    , `limit purports to apply to dangerous dogs (declared) or dangerous dogs (restricted breed) (s 26(2)(d))` IS FALSE

`a local law limit set too high` MEANS `Local Law Limit` WITH
    `number specified as the limit` IS 8
    , `limit purports to apply to dogs kept at a licensed approved kennel establishment (s 26(2)(c))` IS FALSE
    , `limit purports to apply to dangerous dogs (declared) or dangerous dogs (restricted breed) (s 26(2)(d))` IS FALSE

`a local law limit that unlawfully purports to bind dangerous dogs` MEANS `Local Law Limit` WITH
    `number specified as the limit` IS 4
    , `limit purports to apply to dogs kept at a licensed approved kennel establishment (s 26(2)(c))` IS FALSE
    , `limit purports to apply to dangerous dogs (declared) or dangerous dogs (restricted breed) (s 26(2)(d))` IS TRUE

#ASSERT `a local law limit under s 26(1) is validly made` `a compliant local law limit`
#ASSERT NOT (`a local law limit under s 26(1) is validly made` `a local law limit set too high`)
#ASSERT NOT (`a local law limit under s 26(1) is validly made` `a local law limit that unlawfully purports to bind dangerous dogs`)

`a compliant s 26(3) exemption` MEANS `S26(3) Exemption` WITH
    `local government is satisfied the approved-kennel-establishment provisions need not be applied to these premises` IS TRUE
    , `number of dogs (reached 3 months of age) the exemption purports to authorise` IS 6
    , `exemption purports to authorise keeping an underage dog that is not a pup of a dog whose keeping is authorised by the exemption` IS FALSE

`an over-generous s 26(3) exemption` MEANS `S26(3) Exemption` WITH
    `local government is satisfied the approved-kennel-establishment provisions need not be applied to these premises` IS TRUE
    , `number of dogs (reached 3 months of age) the exemption purports to authorise` IS 7
    , `exemption purports to authorise keeping an underage dog that is not a pup of a dog whose keeping is authorised by the exemption` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `an exemption under s 26(3) is validly made` `a compliant s 26(3) exemption`
#ASSERT NOT (`an exemption under s 26(3) is validly made` `an over-generous s 26(3) exemption`)

`unlicensed premises exceeding the ordinary dog limit` MEANS `S26(4) Keeping Facts` WITH
    `premises are licensed under s 27 as an approved kennel establishment` IS FALSE
    , `number of dogs kept at the premises that have reached 3 months of age, other than dangerous dogs` IS 5
    , `the limit applicable to the premises under a local law made under s 26(1), or an exemption granted under s 26(3)` IS 4
    , `number of dangerous dogs (declared) kept at the premises that have reached 3 months of age` IS 0
    , `number of dangerous dogs (restricted breed) kept at the premises that have reached 3 months of age` IS 0
    , `a pup of a dangerous dog (restricted breed), under 3 months of age, is kept at the premises` IS FALSE

`unlicensed premises keeping 3 declared dangerous dogs` MEANS `S26(4) Keeping Facts` WITH
    `premises are licensed under s 27 as an approved kennel establishment` IS FALSE
    , `number of dogs kept at the premises that have reached 3 months of age, other than dangerous dogs` IS 1
    , `the limit applicable to the premises under a local law made under s 26(1), or an exemption granted under s 26(3)` IS 4
    , `number of dangerous dogs (declared) kept at the premises that have reached 3 months of age` IS 3
    , `number of dangerous dogs (restricted breed) kept at the premises that have reached 3 months of age` IS 0
    , `a pup of a dangerous dog (restricted breed), under 3 months of age, is kept at the premises` IS FALSE

`unlicensed premises keeping 2 declared and 2 restricted-breed dangerous dogs` MEANS `S26(4) Keeping Facts` WITH
    `premises are licensed under s 27 as an approved kennel establishment` IS FALSE
    , `number of dogs kept at the premises that have reached 3 months of age, other than dangerous dogs` IS 0
    , `the limit applicable to the premises under a local law made under s 26(1), or an exemption granted under s 26(3)` IS 4
    , `number of dangerous dogs (declared) kept at the premises that have reached 3 months of age` IS 2
    , `number of dangerous dogs (restricted breed) kept at the premises that have reached 3 months of age` IS 2
    , `a pup of a dangerous dog (restricted breed), under 3 months of age, is kept at the premises` IS FALSE

`unlicensed premises keeping 2 declared and 1 restricted-breed dangerous dog` MEANS `S26(4) Keeping Facts` WITH
    `premises are licensed under s 27 as an approved kennel establishment` IS FALSE
    , `number of dogs kept at the premises that have reached 3 months of age, other than dangerous dogs` IS 0
    , `the limit applicable to the premises under a local law made under s 26(1), or an exemption granted under s 26(3)` IS 4
    , `number of dangerous dogs (declared) kept at the premises that have reached 3 months of age` IS 2
    , `number of dangerous dogs (restricted breed) kept at the premises that have reached 3 months of age` IS 1
    , `a pup of a dangerous dog (restricted breed), under 3 months of age, is kept at the premises` IS FALSE

`unlicensed premises keeping an underage restricted-breed pup` MEANS `S26(4) Keeping Facts` WITH
    `premises are licensed under s 27 as an approved kennel establishment` IS FALSE
    , `number of dogs kept at the premises that have reached 3 months of age, other than dangerous dogs` IS 0
    , `the limit applicable to the premises under a local law made under s 26(1), or an exemption granted under s 26(3)` IS 4
    , `number of dangerous dogs (declared) kept at the premises that have reached 3 months of age` IS 0
    , `number of dangerous dogs (restricted breed) kept at the premises that have reached 3 months of age` IS 0
    , `a pup of a dangerous dog (restricted breed), under 3 months of age, is kept at the premises` IS TRUE

`a licensed kennel keeping far more dogs than any limit` MEANS `S26(4) Keeping Facts` WITH
    `premises are licensed under s 27 as an approved kennel establishment` IS TRUE
    , `number of dogs kept at the premises that have reached 3 months of age, other than dangerous dogs` IS 40
    , `the limit applicable to the premises under a local law made under s 26(1), or an exemption granted under s 26(3)` IS 4
    , `number of dangerous dogs (declared) kept at the premises that have reached 3 months of age` IS 5
    , `number of dangerous dogs (restricted breed) kept at the premises that have reached 3 months of age` IS 5
    , `a pup of a dangerous dog (restricted breed), under 3 months of age, is kept at the premises` IS TRUE

`compliant unlicensed premises` MEANS `S26(4) Keeping Facts` WITH
    `premises are licensed under s 27 as an approved kennel establishment` IS FALSE
    , `number of dogs kept at the premises that have reached 3 months of age, other than dangerous dogs` IS 3
    , `the limit applicable to the premises under a local law made under s 26(1), or an exemption granted under s 26(3)` IS 4
    , `number of dangerous dogs (declared) kept at the premises that have reached 3 months of age` IS 1
    , `number of dangerous dogs (restricted breed) kept at the premises that have reached 3 months of age` IS 1
    , `a pup of a dangerous dog (restricted breed), under 3 months of age, is kept at the premises` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `s 26(4)(a) offence -- exceeding the applicable dog-number limit` `unlicensed premises exceeding the ordinary dog limit`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 26(4)(a) offence -- exceeding the applicable dog-number limit` `compliant unlicensed premises`)

#ASSERT `s 26(4)(b) offence -- exceeding the permitted number of dangerous dogs` `unlicensed premises keeping 3 declared dangerous dogs`
#ASSERT `s 26(4)(b) offence -- exceeding the permitted number of dangerous dogs` `unlicensed premises keeping 2 declared and 2 restricted-breed dangerous dogs`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 26(4)(b) offence -- exceeding the permitted number of dangerous dogs` `compliant unlicensed premises`)
-- Boundary witness for the F-S26-4-B-DANGEROUS-DOG-CAP taken reading: 2 declared + 1
-- restricted-breed (3 dangerous dogs total, mixed) trips neither limb (i) (declared not
-- > 2), limb (ii) (restricted not > 2), nor limb (iii) as encoded (requires BOTH counts
-- > 1, and restricted here is only 1) -- so under R-PER-KIND-MIXED this is NOT an
-- offence, unlike under the rejected R-COMBINED-TOTAL reading (3 > 2) where it would be.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 26(4)(b) offence -- exceeding the permitted number of dangerous dogs` `unlicensed premises keeping 2 declared and 1 restricted-breed dangerous dog`)

#ASSERT `s 26(4)(c) offence -- keeping an underage restricted-breed pup outside a licensed kennel` `unlicensed premises keeping an underage restricted-breed pup`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 26(4)(c) offence -- keeping an underage restricted-breed pup outside a licensed kennel` `compliant unlicensed premises`)

#ASSERT `s 26(4) offence -- keeping too many dogs, or an underage restricted-breed pup, outside a licensed kennel` `unlicensed premises exceeding the ordinary dog limit`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 26(4) offence -- keeping too many dogs, or an underage restricted-breed pup, outside a licensed kennel` `a licensed kennel keeping far more dogs than any limit`)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 26(4) offence -- keeping too many dogs, or an underage restricted-breed pup, outside a licensed kennel` `compliant unlicensed premises`)

#ASSERT `s 26(4) penalty` `unlicensed premises exceeding the ordinary dog limit` EQUALS Penalty WITH fine IS JUST 5_000, `minimum fine` IS NOTHING, `imprisonment months` IS NOTHING, `further offence fine` IS JUST 100
#ASSERT `s 26(4) penalty` `unlicensed premises keeping 3 declared dangerous dogs` EQUALS Penalty WITH fine IS JUST 10_000, `minimum fine` IS JUST 500, `imprisonment months` IS NOTHING, `further offence fine` IS JUST 500

`aggrieved by an exemption refusal` MEANS `S26(5) Review Facts` WITH
    `aggrieved by the conditions imposed on an exemption under s 26(3)` IS FALSE
    , `aggrieved by a refusal to grant such an exemption` IS TRUE
    , `aggrieved by the revocation of such an exemption` IS FALSE

`not aggrieved at all` MEANS `S26(5) Review Facts` WITH
    `aggrieved by the conditions imposed on an exemption under s 26(3)` IS FALSE
    , `aggrieved by a refusal to grant such an exemption` IS FALSE
    , `aggrieved by the revocation of such an exemption` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `a person may apply to SAT for review under s 26(5)` `aggrieved by an exemption refusal`
#ASSERT NOT (`a person may apply to SAT for review under s 26(5)` `not aggrieved at all`)

#TRACE `s 26(6) -- deadline to apply to SAT for review under s 26(5)` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Aggrieved Person` DOES `apply to the State Administrative Tribunal for review under s 26(5)` AT 20
-- Result: FULFILLED (applied within the 28-day window)

#TRACE `s 26(6) -- deadline to apply to SAT for review under s 26(5)` AT 0 WITH
    (`WAIT UNTIL` 29)
-- Result: FULFILLED (MAY's benign omission -- the 28-day window lapsed unused, no breach)

`a person who must apply for a kennel licence` MEANS `S27(1) Application Trigger` WITH
    `a limit is imposed under s 26(1)(a) or (b) on the number of dogs that can be kept at the premises` IS TRUE
    , `person proposes to keep more than that number of dogs in or at premises in that area` IS TRUE
    , `the premises are not exempt from the limitation` IS TRUE

`a person exempt from the s 26 limit` MEANS `S27(1) Application Trigger` WITH
    `a limit is imposed under s 26(1)(a) or (b) on the number of dogs that can be kept at the premises` IS TRUE
    , `person proposes to keep more than that number of dogs in or at premises in that area` IS TRUE
    , `the premises are not exempt from the limitation` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `the person must apply under s 27(1) for the premises to be licensed as an approved kennel establishment` `a person who must apply for a kennel licence`
#ASSERT NOT (`the person must apply under s 27(1) for the premises to be licensed as an approved kennel establishment` `a person exempt from the s 26 limit`)

`a kennel operator breaching the licence terms` MEANS `S27(2) Offence Facts` WITH
    `dog kept, or permitted or suffered to be kept, is over the age of 3 months` IS TRUE
    , `dog is of a breed or kind to which the licence applies` IS TRUE
    , `dog is kept at an approved kennel establishment` IS TRUE
    , `the keeping is otherwise than in accordance with the licence relating to that establishment` IS TRUE

`a kennel operator keeping dogs in accordance with the licence` MEANS `S27(2) Offence Facts` WITH
    `dog kept, or permitted or suffered to be kept, is over the age of 3 months` IS TRUE
    , `dog is of a breed or kind to which the licence applies` IS TRUE
    , `dog is kept at an approved kennel establishment` IS TRUE
    , `the keeping is otherwise than in accordance with the licence relating to that establishment` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `s 27(2) offence -- keeping a dog at an approved kennel establishment otherwise than in accordance with its licence` `a kennel operator breaching the licence terms`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 27(2) offence -- keeping a dog at an approved kennel establishment otherwise than in accordance with its licence` `a kennel operator keeping dogs in accordance with the licence`)

`a licence within its 12-month term` MEANS `S27(5) Licence Status Facts` WITH
    `months elapsed since the licence was granted or last renewed` IS 6
    , `the licence has been cancelled under s 27(6)` IS FALSE

`a licence that has lapsed` MEANS `S27(5) Licence Status Facts` WITH
    `months elapsed since the licence was granted or last renewed` IS 13
    , `the licence has been cancelled under s 27(6)` IS FALSE

`a licence that has been cancelled` MEANS `S27(5) Licence Status Facts` WITH
    `months elapsed since the licence was granted or last renewed` IS 2
    , `the licence has been cancelled under s 27(6)` IS TRUE

#ASSERT `the approved kennel establishment licence remains in force` `a licence within its 12-month term`
#ASSERT NOT (`the approved kennel establishment licence remains in force` `a licence that has lapsed`)
#ASSERT NOT (`the approved kennel establishment licence remains in force` `a licence that has been cancelled`)

`a compliant s 27(6) cancellation notice` MEANS `S27(6) Cancellation Notice` WITH
    `period specified in the notice, in months, at the end of which the licence is cancelled` IS 3

`a cancellation notice with too short a period` MEANS `S27(6) Cancellation Notice` WITH
    `period specified in the notice, in months, at the end of which the licence is cancelled` IS 2

#ASSERT `the s 27(6) cancellation notice satisfies its content requirement` `a compliant s 27(6) cancellation notice`
#ASSERT NOT (`the s 27(6) cancellation notice satisfies its content requirement` `a cancellation notice with too short a period`)

`a refused kennel-licence applicant` MEANS `S27(7) Review Facts` WITH
    `the local government refuses the grant of a licence under s 27` IS TRUE
    , `notice of the cancellation of a licence under s 27 is given` IS FALSE

`a kennel licensee with no cause for review` MEANS `S27(7) Review Facts` WITH
    `the local government refuses the grant of a licence under s 27` IS FALSE
    , `notice of the cancellation of a licence under s 27 is given` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `the applicant or licensee may apply to SAT for review under s 27(7)` `a refused kennel-licence applicant`
#ASSERT NOT (`the applicant or licensee may apply to SAT for review under s 27(7)` `a kennel licensee with no cause for review`)
